{"lines": [{"text": "Why you should never tell a car dealer how you're paying.", "start": 0.05, "end": 2.186, "spec": {"type": "hero"}, "words": [["Why", 0.086, 0.194], ["you", 0.194, 0.259], ["should", 0.259, 0.388], ["never", 0.399, 0.571], ["tell", 0.571, 0.733], ["a", 0.733, 0.765], ["car", 0.765, 0.959], ["dealer", 0.97, 1.218], ["how", 1.228, 1.325], ["you're", 1.325, 1.455], ["paying", 1.455, 1.81]]}, {"text": "Dealers make almost as much on financing and add-ons as on the car itself.", "start": 2.266, "end": 6.658, "spec": {"type": "profit"}, "words": [["Dealers", 0.086, 0.356], ["make", 0.356, 0.506], ["almost", 0.55, 0.905], ["as", 0.916, 0.991], ["much", 0.991, 1.358], ["on", 1.358, 1.466], ["financing", 1.466, 2.188], ["and", 2.188, 2.274], ["add-ons", 2.284, 2.953], ["as", 3.082, 3.2], ["on", 3.211, 3.287], ["the", 3.287, 3.341], ["car", 3.341, 3.534], ["itself", 3.545, 4.062]]}, {"text": "Ask for low monthly payments, and they can just stretch the loan, so you pay thousands more.", "start": 6.738, "end": 11.778, "spec": {"type": "stretch"}, "words": [["Ask", 0.086, 0.345], ["for", 0.345, 0.442], ["low", 0.442, 0.625], ["monthly", 0.625, 0.905], ["payments", 0.905, 1.476], ["and", 1.606, 1.907], ["they", 2.252, 2.349], ["can", 2.349, 2.435], ["just", 2.435, 2.586], ["stretch", 2.586, 2.877], ["the", 2.888, 2.974], ["loan", 2.985, 3.308], ["so", 3.545, 3.631], ["you", 3.631, 3.739], ["pay", 3.75, 3.966], ["thousands", 3.976, 4.397], ["more", 4.407, 4.72]]}, {"text": "They can also add about two percentage points to your rate.", "start": 11.858, "end": 14.546, "spec": {"type": "rate", "cut": true}, "words": [["They", 0.097, 0.14], ["can", 0.151, 0.226], ["also", 0.237, 0.528], ["add", 0.539, 0.668], ["about", 0.668, 0.937], ["two", 0.948, 1.121], ["percentage", 1.131, 1.53], ["points", 1.541, 1.864], ["to", 1.864, 1.961], ["your", 1.961, 2.069], ["rate", 2.08, 2.371]]}, {"text": "On forty thousand dollars, that's over two thousand extra.", "start": 14.626